@startuml
title SSD - Create and Submit Vessel Visit Notification

actor "Shipping Agent Representative" as Agent
boundary "VesselVisitNotificationController" as Controller
control "VesselVisitNotificationService" as Service
entity "VesselVisitNotificationRepository" as Repository
database "PortManagementContext (EF Core)" as DB

== Create Vessel Visit Notification ==
Agent -> Controller : POST /api/vesselvisitnotification\n(VesselVisitNotificationDTO)
Controller -> Service : CreateAsync(dto)
Service -> Repository : AddAsync(VesselVisitNotification)
Repository -> DB : INSERT VesselVisitNotification
DB --> Repository : Confirmation
Repository --> Service : VesselVisitNotification
Service --> Controller : VesselVisitNotificationDTO
Controller --> Agent : 201 Created (VesselVisitNotificationDTO)

 == Later: Submit Visit Notification ==

Agent -> Controller : PUT /api/vesselvisitnotification/{id}/submit
Controller -> Service : SubmitAsync(id)
Service -> Repository : GetByIdAsync(id)
Repository -> DB : SELECT * FROM VesselVisitNotifications WHERE Id = id
DB --> Repository : VesselVisitNotification
Repository --> Service : VesselVisitNotification
Service -> Service : MarkAsSubmitted()
Service -> Repository : UpdateAsync(VesselVisitNotification)
Repository -> DB : UPDATE VesselVisitNotifications SET Status='Submitted'
DB --> Repository : OK
Repository --> Service : Confirmation
Service --> Controller : Success
Controller --> Agent : 204 No Content

@enduml
